    subpopulations with poor calibration requiring targeted intervention. Includes temperature 
    scaling, Platt scaling, and isotonic regression as recalibration methods."""@en ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom reliability:CalibrationMonitoring .

testing:CapacityTest a owl:Class,
